  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: bb08586d69ecf85489aef25def86d39a, type: 3}
  m_Name: Intro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  id: 0
  text:
  - Some apartments should never be opened...
  - This one hasn't been cleaned since the old couple passed away.
  - The dust kept growing.
  - Then it started moving.
  - Some would call it impossible.
  - Mom would call it "your fault".
  - Standard cleaning methods were attempted.
  - They failed...
  - <size=150%>You</size>\nwere called.
  - Destroy the nests and\ncontain the infestation.
  - The air is <color=#DEDEDE>contaminated</color> and your <color=#DEDEDE>filtration
    system</color> won't last forever.
  - Start cleaning.\n\nLeave nothing behind.
  - <size=300%>Suck.  It.  Up.</size>
  nextScene: MainMenu
  music: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5c637fd62b5cfe049a2533fa8cfe3ad6, type: 3}
